{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45210","headline":"兵後余不亭重送卢孟明游江西 · 皎然","name":"兵後余不亭重送卢孟明游江西","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"携手曾此分，怳如隔胡越。\n伦侯古封邑，荣盛风雨歇。\n饥鼯号空亭，野草生故辙。\n如何此路岐，更作千年别。\n冯轼望远道，春山无断绝。\n朝行入郢树，夜泊依楚月。\n佳士持操高，扬才日昭晰。\n离言何所赠，盈满有亏缺。\n时节伤蟪蛄，芳菲忌鶗鴂。\n予思鹿门隐，心迹贵冥灭。\n颓颜反芝术，昔貌成冰雪。\n岁晏期尔来，销声坐岩穴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45210.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45210","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}